<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-10-24T07:29:10.368Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 07:29:10 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican authorities have charged a state prosecutor with treason for alleged U.S. involvement in a drug raid, while a Texas man was indicted for buying firearms in Amarillo to supply the Sinaloa Cartel. A Sinaloa Cartel transporter pleaded guilty to trafficking methamphetamine and marijuana, and another smuggler admitted moving tens of thousands of pounds of drugs in federal court. The AI-powered intelligence platform that tracked the death of El Mencho is now being used to locate the next cartel boss. The conflict’s historical toll includes 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTE03RnZsbXlOMzRUb29RMHJYc1E2N1h2WmNwODdJWmhfYlJEUGN4R0ZZdEF0VEdHMEppN3ZUbWJCaXJtR0Y5Nzl3V0JIZG9yRGs0S3FxMlFxcHUzaUtnVHF1YXVZeHptWFNaSHRRMmlxMjhXUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;CrashOut by Ioan Grillo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;upi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxNa0dYVDgxaWdHVlVlMmZJakNhTFZhQ2drRGl3N21PQS13Znhrb1Itd1ItVkc0aVVHWFJ3NUhvQk40Vlc3R2lfcTdHWlpSR0tCMUJsazVYVEZrVnZzYl9OejhNcEJvNmNOSThEYUxwWnZ3Z01YV0tqYTdUaHNnTTYyX0ZnQkZyYlBFM0hxckZjZ2lkUWNURmFUMU1MRlR5R00wdHJxdlcwaVdwanBTbTBYbWNmWlQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latin Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE1YbDJKVkgwanhsakpXQmY3cy01aUlDa0hRTWU4a0hyNUZsamxSejJuNnNVRW1zWGtmVGsxdkZKdnU0Z2V6aGxLM0cwbExVNV9VR0FRQ2hLRi1XUDVneUloRnNYQ2lFVndRazhiQjlnRjFJbmZDWU5HMWd3?oc=5&quot;&gt;CBS News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;KOKI FOX 23&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxOM1ZPSi1KaUdRZUhlUXAxRXV5RUhCbk4tZXN3bXZOZDRpck5IeDNvcmNFc0w2bVNlbVlpb0JfWm1yOXBnZHJLU294cG5f